  - id: Viz_3
    viz_guid: 9bde091e-d4ff-4e2e-9f98-ce45600b53b1
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: "<h1><span>Read me: </span></h1><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\"><br></p><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hi, welcome to this Liveboard! We have built this Demo liveboard with some demo analyses on a generic retail apparel data set. The idea behind this Liveboard is to allow users to review the capabilities of the platform and give you a feeling of what it can help them achieve.</span></p><ol><li value=\"1\"><span>If you need a more personalized introduction to ThoughtSpot, feel free to reach out to your data tem. We'll be happy to run you through the product &amp; our offerings within your company.</span><br></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Want to learn more about ThoughtSpot, check </span><a href=\"https://training.thoughtspot.com/page/learning-paths#business_user\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"theme-module__editor-link\"><span>ThoughtSpot University</span></a><span> for beginners / advanced lessons.</span><br></li><li value=\"3\"><span>You can find more tips &amp; tricks on </span><a href=\"https://docs.thoughtspot.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"theme-module__editor-link\"><span>ThoughtSpot Documentation</span></a><span>.</span></li></ol>"
