  - id: Viz_29
    viz_guid: 76d0e801-4532-4201-897f-e75944b9fe75
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Group Aggregates</span></h2><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>What if you want to aggregate a value by a specific attribute (for example, show revenue by product)? This is known as a grouped aggregation, but some people call it a pinned measure or level-based measure. You can do this for any aggregation using the grouping functions.</span></p><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span>Further details can be found on </span><a href=\"https://docs.thoughtspot.com/cloud/latest/formulas-aggregation-group\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"theme-module__editor-link\"><span>ThoughtSpot documentation</span></a><span>. We also advise you to check this YouTube video on ThoughtSpot </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TtGowhU-i_o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"theme-module__editor-link\"><span>Level of Devel Analysis</span></a></p><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span>Below are some examples of group aggregation/level of details formulas that you can use on ThoughtSpot.</span></p>"
  - id: Viz_30
    answer:
      name: Year to Date Sales Trend
      description: "If Red, its bad! If Green, its good!"
      tables:
      - id: (Sample) Retail - Apparel
        name: (Sample) Retail - Apparel
        fqn: cd252e5c-b552-49a8-821d-3eadaa049cca
      formulas:
      - id: formula_% Difference
        name: '% Difference'
        expr: "[sales(this year)] / [sales(last year year to date)]"
        was_auto_generated: false
      - id: formula_Dummy
        name: Dummy
        expr: ''''''
        was_auto_generated: false
      - id: formula_Trend
        name: Trend
        expr: "if ( [sales(this year)] < [sales(last year year to date)] ) then '🔴' else '🟢'"
        was_auto_generated: false
      search_query: "[sales] [date].'this year' vs [date].'last year' [date].'year to date' [formula_Dummy] [formula_% Difference] [formula_Trend] [region].east [region].midwest [region].south [region].southwest [region].west"
      answer_columns:
      - name: '% Difference'
        format:
          category: PERCENTAGE
          percentageFormatConfig:
            decimals: 2.0
          isCategoryEditable: true
      - name: Dummy
      - name: Trend
      - name: sales(last year year to date)
      - name: sales(this year)
      table:
        table_columns:
        - column_id: '% Difference'
          show_headline: false
        - column_id: Dummy
          show_headline: false
        - column_id: Trend
          show_headline: false
        - column_id: sales(last year year to date)
          show_headline: false
        - column_id: sales(this year)
          show_headline: false
        ordered_column_ids:
        - Trend
        - Dummy
        - sales(last year year to date)
        - '% Difference'
        - sales(this year)
        client_state: ""
        client_state_v2: "{\"tableVizPropVersion\": \"V1\"}"
      chart:
        type: KPI
        chart_columns:
        - column_id: '% Difference'
        - column_id: Dummy
        - column_id: Trend
        - column_id: sales(last year year to date)
        - column_id: sales(this year)
        axis_configs:
        - "y":
          - Trend
        client_state: ""
        client_state_v2: "{\"version\": \"V4DOT2\",\"chartProperties\": {\"gridLines\": {},\"responsiveLayoutPreference\": \"USER_PREFERRED_ON\",\"chartSpecific\": {\"dataFieldArea\": \"column\"}},\"columnProperties\": [{\"columnId\": \"Dummy\",\"columnProperty\": {}},{\"columnId\": \"sales(last year year to date)\",\"columnProperty\": {}},{\"columnId\": \"sales(this year)\",\"columnProperty\": {}},{\"columnId\": \"% Difference\",\"columnProperty\": {\"conditionalFormatting\": {\"rows\": [{\"operator\": \"GREATER_THAN\",\"value\": \"100\",\"plotAsBand\": false,\"fontProperties\": {\"color\": \"#06BF7F\"}},{\"operator\": \"LESS_THAN\",\"value\": \"100\",\"plotAsBand\": false,\"fontProperties\": {\"color\": \"#F04152\"}},{\"operator\": \"EQUAL_TO\",\"value\": \"100\",\"plotAsBand\": false}]}}},{\"columnId\": \"Trend\",\"columnProperty\": {}}],\"axisProperties\": [{\"id\": \"a50a4f74-b185-4658-b81e-152cac548ac3\",\"properties\": {\"axisType\": \"Y\",\"linkedColumns\": [\"Trend\"],\"isOpposite\": false}},{\"id\": \"1d7c0604-b654-4129-b0e5-ae8d2de025d3\",\"properties\": {\"axisType\": \"X\"}}],\"systemSeriesColors\": [{\"serieName\": \"sales(last year year to date)\",\"color\": \"#48D1E0\"},{\"serieName\": \"sales(this year)\",\"color\": \"#2e75f0\"},{\"serieName\": \"% Difference\",\"color\": \"#FCC838\"}],\"tooltipConfig\": {}}"
      display_mode: CHART_MODE
    viz_guid: 2c3ce35b-1a05-45bf-891c-b7d4fc89d2b8
